      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Upload a short clip of one speaker in **Your Clip**. The same clip is the voice sample.\n3. Press **Run**. The Spanish dub is saved under `dub/approved` or `dub/review`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
